name 'pl-ai-101-V2-mod5-bias-02_2026'
title 'Check For Understanding: Bias'
description ''
question 'Which of the following is NOT an example of algorithmic bias?'

wrong 'A hiring tool trained on past company data that consistently ranks candidates higher if they attended certain universities that have historically enrolled less diverse student populations.'
wrong  'A language translation system that produces slightly different levels of fluency and nuance depending on how frequently certain languages appear in its training data.'
wrong 'An online advertising system that shows job advertisements for high-paying executive positions more frequently to men than to women, based on historical clicking patterns.'
right 'A recommendation system that suggests different types of products to users based on their past browsing behavior and stated preferences.'
allow_multiple_attempts true